# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECURITY HEADERS — served by Cloudflare Workers Assets
#
#  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS, AND WHY next.config.ts ALONE IS NOT ENOUGH.
#
#  wrangler.jsonc binds `.vercel/output/static` as ASSETS. Cloudflare serves a
#  matching static file DIRECTLY from that layer and never invokes the
#  Worker — and every prerendered HTML page is such a file. `headers()` in
#  next.config.ts runs inside the Worker, so it only ever applied to the
#  requests that fell through to it (API routes, dynamic pages, 404s).
#
#  The result in production was that `/`, `/login` and `/legal/privacy`
#  went out with no security headers at all, while a request for a
#  non-existent `/_next/static/*.js` — which does reach the Worker —
#  carried the full set. Mozilla Observatory scored the site 5/100.
#
#  So: this file covers the asset layer, next.config.ts covers the Worker,
#  and next.config.ts PARSES THIS FILE so the two can never drift apart.
#  Edit the policy here; the Worker picks it up at build time.
#
#  SCRIPT-SRC IS DELIBERATELY HASH-ONLY HERE.
#  A prerendered page carries Next.js's inline flight scripts, and the asset
#  layer cannot mint the nonce the middleware uses — the file was written at
#  build time. `'unsafe-inline'` was the old way out and it neutered the
#  policy (Observatory: -20). Instead `scripts/build-csp-headers.mjs` runs
#  after the build, hashes the inline scripts of each page, and rewrites the
#  DEPLOYED copy of this file with one policy per page. So the script-src
#  below is the base the hashes are appended to — leave it hash-ready, and
#  never add `'unsafe-inline'` back to it.
#
#  The same script also appends the backend's origin to connect-src, from
#  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL. It cannot be written here: this file is static
#  and the value differs per deploy. Don't hardcode one — set the variable.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.anthropic.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
